{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 是面向 DSH 网页端的会话门控插件：它按北京时间峰值时段、周末及节假日状态管理会话推进，并可按请求目标的 DeepSeek 官方 provider 进行判断。插件接入 host 的请求与 step 生命周期，提供暂停、恢复和取消命令、会话状态接口及输入区状态徽标；还支持延后高峰请求、持久化暂停状态和可选的瞬时错误自动重试。适合希望控制高峰期模型请求并管理会话暂停的 DSH 用户。可在设置中配置时段、门控范围和重试选项；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:45","src/wiring.js:152","src/client/index.ts:166"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#card-en","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-guard gates DSH web sessions by Beijing peak hours, weekends, and holidays. It checks request providers, defers peak requests, and adds pause, resume, cancel, status routes, and a composer badge. Optional retry handles failures. Configure schedules; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:45","src/wiring.js:152","src/client/index.ts:166"]}
