{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#feature-1","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 的功能「峰值与周末门控」：插件按北京时间峰值窗口和周末状态驱动会话门；启用 step 模式时，在下一步模型请求前等待，离开峰值后可释放门控。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wiring.js:152","src/wiring.js:268"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#feature-2","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 的功能「官方 provider 请求判定」：请求守卫检查当前 provider 与端点；高峰期对官方源请求进行等待或延后处理，已知本地及第三方目标可以继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/request-guard.js:60","src/request-guard.js:121"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#feature-3","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 的功能「手动暂停与恢复」：通过 /pause、/resume 和 /cancel 命令控制当前会话，也可通过客户端暂停按钮操作并查看门控状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:199","src/index.js:214","src/client/index.ts:166"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#feature-4","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 的功能「输入区状态徽标」：网页客户端在输入区右侧显示当前峰值、低谷或周末状态，并从 session-guard 状态路由获取信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:177","src/index.js:312"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-session-guard#caveat-1","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-session-guard","commit":"f67fa27e2727d6521c39c3c0a0e20a3f0d32a409","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-guard 使用前须知：节假日表可按设置联网刷新：启动后插件可从 jsDelivr 获取年度数据，并在备用源尝试；设为离线模式可禁用自动抓取。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/holiday-store.js:38","src/index.js:56"]}
